---
import { getEntry } from 'astro:content';
import Layout from '../../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = "Staff Design Ops Interview Panel";
const breadcrumbs = [
  { text: 'Interview Panels', href: '/docs/levels/interview-panels' },
  { text: 'Design Ops', href: '/docs/levels/interview-panels/design-ops' }
];
---

<style>
  .role-section h2 {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: #111827;
  }

  .role-table {
    background: white;
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin: 0;
  }

  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin: 0;
  }

  thead tr {
    background: #f9fafb;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
  }

  th {
    text-align: left;
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #4b5563;
    margin: 0;
  }

  td {
    padding: 0.875rem 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #f3f4f6;
  }

  tr:hover td {
    background: #f9fafb;
  }
</style>

<Layout title={title}>
  <main class="py-8 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <article class="max-w-[680px] mx-auto">
      <nav class="flex mb-2" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <ol class="flex items-center">
          {breadcrumbs.map((crumb, index) => (
            <li class="flex items-center">
              {index > 0 && <span class="mx-2 text-gray-400">/</span>}
              <a href={crumb.href} class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-900">
                {crumb.text}
              </a>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ol>
      </nav>
      
      <div class="prose max-w-none">
        <h1 class="text-[32px] font-semibold text-[#1a1f36] tracking-[-0.4px] mb-6">Staff Design Ops</h1>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Interview Stages</h2>
        <div class="role-table mb-6">
          <table>
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Stage</th>
                <th>Interviewer(s)</th>
                <th>Duration</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><td>Recruiter Screen</td><td>[Recruiter Name]</td><td>30 min</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Hiring Manager Screen</td><td>[Hiring Manager Name]</td><td>45 min</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Strategic Case Study</td><td>All Hiring Team</td><td>60 min</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Round 2: Design Leadership</td><td>[Design Leaders]</td><td>45 min</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Round 2: Technical Systems</td><td>[Technical Leaders]</td><td>45 min</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Round 2: Cross-functional</td><td>[Cross-functional Partners]</td><td>45 min</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Final/Executive Round</td><td>Executive Team Members</td><td>45 min</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>

        <section class="mb-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">Recruiter Screen</h3>
          <p class="italic text-sm mb-2">Focus Areas: Technical Expertise, Strategic Vision, Systems Thinking</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6">
            <li>What drew you to design operations at a staff level, and what excites you about this opportunity?</li>
            <li>Tell me about a time when you designed and implemented complex operational systems for design teams.</li>
            <li>How do you approach solving deep technical or systemic challenges in design operations?</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">Hiring Manager Screen</h3>
          <p class="italic text-sm mb-2">Focus Areas: Technical Leadership, Systems Architecture, Organizational Impact</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6">
            <li>How do you approach designing operational systems that can scale across a large organization?</li>
            <li>Tell me about a time you solved a complex, systemic design operations challenge.</li>
            <li>How do you measure the impact of technical or systemic improvements to design operations?</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">Strategic Case Study</h3>
          <p class="italic text-sm mb-2">Focus Areas: Technical Depth, Systems Design, Organizational Impact</p>
          <p>The candidate should present a case study of a complex, technical design operations system or framework they designed and implemented. The presentation should cover the technical and organizational challenges they identified, their approach to designing the solution, how they implemented it across the organization, and the measurable impact it had. The case study should demonstrate their deep technical expertise, systems thinking, and ability to drive organizational change through technical excellence.</p>
        </section>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-700 mt-8 mb-3">Round 2 Interviews</h3>
        <div class="pl-4 border-l-2 border-gray-200">
          <section class="mb-6">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">Design Leadership Interview</h3>
            <p class="italic text-sm mb-2">Focus Areas: Design Systems Integration, Technical Enablement, Strategic Impact</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6">
              <li>How do you design operational systems that integrate with and enhance design systems?</li>
              <li>Tell me about a time you used technical expertise to solve a significant design challenge.</li>
              <li>How do you balance technical excellence with designer experience in your solutions?</li>
              <li>What approaches have you used to scale technical design operations solutions globally?</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section class="mb-6">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">Technical Systems Interview</h3>
            <p class="italic text-sm mb-2">Focus Areas: Technical Depth, Systems Architecture, Tool Integration</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6">
              <li>How do you approach designing technical systems for design operations at scale?</li>
              <li>Tell me about a time you had to integrate multiple tools or systems into a cohesive workflow.</li>
              <li>How do you evaluate new technologies or tools for potential adoption?</li>
              <li>What's your approach to designing systems that can evolve with changing organizational needs?</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section class="mb-6">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">Cross-functional Interview</h3>
            <p class="italic text-sm mb-2">Focus Areas: Technical Partnership, System Integration, Organizational Influence</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6">
              <li>How do you build technical partnerships across the organization?</li>
              <li>Tell me about a time you led a cross-functional technical initiative.</li>
              <li>How do you ensure your technical systems integrate well with other organizational systems?</li>
              <li>What's your approach to gaining buy-in for complex technical changes across the organization?</li>
            </ul>
          </section>
        </div>

        <section class="mb-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">Final/Executive Round</h3>
          <p class="italic text-sm mb-2">Focus Areas: Strategic Vision, Business Impact, Technical Leadership</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6">
            <li>What's your vision for how technical excellence in design operations can drive business success?</li>
            <li>How do you communicate complex technical concepts to executive stakeholders?</li>
            <li>Tell me about a time you had to make a significant technical decision with business implications.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>
